The dish is a square-ish plate, probably a side plate of about 20-22 cm. It holds roughly 12 cooked carrot slices, cut on the bias and fairly thick.

Each slice is about 8-10 g, so 12 slices come to roughly 100-120 g. Cooked carrots have about 35-40 kcal per 100 g, or a little more if they are glazed. That gives about 45 kcal, and I'll round up to 50 to allow for a glaze.

